  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://arxiv.org/pdf/2308.12943"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2308.12943"],
 "). \[LineSeparator]If not in ",
 StyleBox["kinetic.wl",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", compute and store the relative spectrum.",
 " "
}], "Item",
