Cell["\<\
OmegaGW2f\[LineSeparator]The 2-fluid gravitational wave spectrum (Eq. 45 of \
arXiv xx.yy).\[LineSeparator]Two additional parameters govern this spectrum:\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002089561608471*^9, 4.0020895644598703`*^9}, {
